cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Galaxy Visualization"
message: "This repository provides code and a cleaned/derived galaxy redshift dataset. 
All original data remain the property of the respective surveys and authors. 
If you use the derived dataset, please cite both the original surveys and this repository for the code/derived dataset."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Anderssén
    given-names: Victor

